# Content-hashed sibling chunks the lazy-pack bundles dynamic-import
# (Geometry-XXXX.js etc.) — copied from .deck/ by copy-sui-assets.ts.
# Committed source under public/ lives in subdirs (tutorial/), never
# at the root, so a root-level hashed .js is always a generated copy.
public/*-*.js
